  "bio": "Andrea Giulimondi is a highly skilled and prolific traditional tattoo artist who can be found at Riverside Tattoo London. With an impressive traditional style, he has successfully captivated the attention of nearly 114,000 followers on Instagram. A member of the Tigerspitbalm family, he's internationally recognized and appreciated for his polished, detail-oriented tattoo designs.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location:\n\n✉️ andreagiulimondi@hotmail.com INQUIRIES: DM/email \n📍owner  @riversidetattoolondon \n📍co-owner @swansongtattoo  \n⭕️ @tigerspitbalm family",
